        {"zh": "我先在高处盘了一圈", "en": "I circle once up high"},
        {"zh": "我从半空里斜落下来", "en": "I slant down out of the air"},
        {"zh": "翅膀收拢的声音很轻", "en": "My wings fold with a light sound"}
